<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia 2020 indexed T-bond yields 4.586.</title>
<headline>Australia 2020 indexed T-bond yields 4.586.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of today's A$250 million indexed Treasury bond tender, announced by Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA):</p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering     Allotted	Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  4.0 Aug 2020 AS250 mln    A$251.000 mln  4.586	4.54-4.61</p>
<p>(RBA take-up A$20 million, pct allotted at top 95)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
